      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُضَانَاةٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعَانَاةٌ</span>, (S, K, KL,) both signifying The <i>suffering,</i> or <i>enduring,</i> [or <i>contending
with,</i>], <i>the difficulty,</i> or <i>trouble,</i> or <i>inconvenience,</i>
of a thing; as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقَاسَاةٌ</span>. (KL.)

